## Chrome DevTools frontend

The optional experimental Inspector distributes a locally compiled copy of
[chrome-devtools-frontend](https://www.npmjs.com/package/chrome-devtools-frontend),
from upstream Chromium revision [0e1186138ed519d9659c1874bf6375eca4483c72](https://chromium.googlesource.com/devtools/devtools-frontend/+/${DEVTOOLS_SOURCE_REVISION}).

The build includes the Chromium [BSD-3-Clause license](packages/experimental/inspector/assets/devtools/LICENSE)
and the third-party license and notice files supplied by the npm source.
The Chromium root license does not replace those dependencies' licenses.

Key third-party components in the DevTools bundle:

| Component | License |
|---|---|
| axe-core | MPL-2.0 |
| codemirror | MIT |
| codemirror.next | MIT |
| chromium (core) | BSD-style |
| diff | Apache-2.0 |
| i18n | Apache-2.0 |
| intl-messageformat | BSD-3-Clause |
| json5 | MIT |
| legacy-javascript | Apache-2.0 |
| lighthouse | Apache-2.0 |
| lit | BSD-3-Clause |
| marked | MIT |
| puppeteer | Apache-2.0 |
| source-map-scopes-codec | Chromium-style |
| third-party-web | MIT |
| web-vitals | Apache-2.0 |

See individual LICENSE files under
`packages/experimental/inspector/lib/devtools/third_party/<component>/`
for complete terms.

